      "content": "the water is already up to the floorboards in the lower cabins. i can hear the hull groaning like it’s about to snap in half. there's no way out of this, is there? it feels so pointless to keep scrambling for lifeboats when we all know the ship is going down. it just feels like a slow, terrifying way to die.",
